# TAG Project Naming and Structure

## Application Information

- **App Name**: The Asset Guardian (TAG) CMMS-EAM
- **Publisher**: Verosoft Design INC. (VSD)
- **Runtime**: 12.0
- **Application Version**: 22.0.0.0

## Object ID Ranges

Always use IDs within these assigned ranges:

| Range | From | To | Purpose |
|-------|------|-----|---------|
| Primary | 70015000 | 70016999 | Main TAG objects |
| API | 23085634 | 23085783 | API pages and related objects |

## Object Naming Pattern

All TAG objects must follow this naming convention:

    [ObjectType] [ObjectID] - TAG [ObjectName].al

### Examples by Object Type

| Type | Example Filename |
|------|------------------|
| Table | Table 70016325 - TAG Key Safe.al |
| Page | Page 23085760 - TAG Key Safe List.al |
| Codeunit | Codeunit 70015921 - TAG Evalulate AutoPlan.al |
| Report | Report 70015908 - TAG Evaluate Policies.al |
| Enum | Enum 70015900 - TAG Equipment Status.al |
| Query | Query 70015900 - TAG Equipment Query.al |
| XMLport | XMLport 70015900 - TAG Import Equipment Groups.al |

### API Pages

API pages use camelCase for entity names:

    Page [ID] - TAG API [EntityName].al

Example: Page 23085779 - TAG API Key Safes.al

## Internal Object Names

Object names in code must include the "TAG" prefix:

    table 70016325 "TAG Key Safe"
    page 23085760 "TAG Key Safe List"
    codeunit 70015921 "TAG Evalulate AutoPlan"
    enum 70015900 "TAG Equipment Status"

## Field Naming

- Use descriptive field names with proper spacing
- Primary key fields are typically Code or No.
- Reference fields should indicate the relationship

    field(1; Code; Code[20])
    field(3; Description; Text[250])
    field(4; "Equipment ID"; Code[20])
    field(5; "Work Order No."; Code[20])

## Directory Structure

    BC/
    +-- API/              # API pages (PageType = API)
    +-- CodeUnit/         # Codeunits
    +-- controladdin/     # Control add-ins
    +-- Enums/            # Enum definitions
    +-- Page_Extension/   # Page extensions
    +-- Pages/            # Standard pages
    +-- permissionSets/   # Permission sets
    +-- Profile/          # Role center profiles
    +-- Queries/          # Query objects
    +-- Reports/          # Reports and RDLC layouts
    +-- Table_Extension/  # Table extensions
    +-- tables/           # Table definitions
    +-- TAGProject/       # Project management tables/pages
    +-- Translations/     # XLF translation files
    +-- XMLport/          # XMLport definitions

